    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Property Home and Away have the pleasure in launching this impressive double fronted six bedroom, four bathroom family home in the much sought after Brompton Grove in Castleknock.\r\nThis is a 200SqM property and comes with a 24SqM detached block shed with tiled roof to rear . \r\nThere are six-bedrooms, two with ensuite bathrooms, a family bathroom & downstairs toilet. You have three reception rooms, lounge, dining room, family room, music room, kitchen and dining area. \r\nThis is a double fronted home which looks out to an open green space & has parking for four cars off street. The rear garden is south-east facing.    \r\n\r\nLocation is excellent, close to  Phoenix Park and all social amenities. There is a host of shops and restaurants close by. You are one kilometer from train station and have easy access to the N3 & M50, bringing you to the city & Dublin airport. Catchment area for primary & secondary schools is excellent. Viewing is strictly by appointment through Agent."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall\t5.46 x 2.77 \tSpacious hall with porch area, comes with feature staircase with view to open landing area.\r\n\r\nKitchen   6.70 x 4.0      Extended Kitchen & dining area with copious amounts of fitted units & storage.      \r\n\r\nMusic room \t4.32 x 2.90   Open space with piano, links rooms on ground floor.   \r\n\t\t\r\nLounge & Dining Room\t8.34 X 3.46\tLarge family size living space with feature fireplace. Dual aspect windows in lounge and dining room bring natural light flowing in. \r\n \r\nBedroom 1   3.64 x 3.57  Maple wood flooring, painted décor and ensuite.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2   3.90 x 2.92 \tWall to Wall wardrobes with wool carpet and wall paper décor. \r\n\r\nBedroom 3\t3.52 x 2.74  \tLarge double bedroom with maple wood flooring.  \r\n\r\nBedroom 4      3.98 x 2.97    Double room with wool carpet.  \r\n\r\nBedroom 5    3.23 x 2.50  Built in waredrobes, wool carpet and wallpaper décor\r\n\r\nBedroom 6    4.96 x 3.94   Downstairs double bedroom with ensuite bathroom.\r\n\r\nDetached Shed  5.72 x 4.14     24SqM Block Shed with Tiled roof, wide variety of uses.\r\n\r\nD/s Toilet    \t               Just off hall, white sanitary units & painted décor.\r\n\r\nBathroom     3.27 x 2.58  Fully tiled wall to ceiling, feature bath and white sanitary units."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "- 6 bedroom home with 4 bathrooms\t\r\n- Large garden frontage with off street parking   \r\n- Close to train station \t\t\t\r\n- 24SqM detached block shed with tiled roof        \r\n- Double Fronted Property\t\t\r\n- Easy Access to M50, City & Airport"
      },
